{"id":"n64638-1-8","stage":2,"title":"스케줄 · 时间表","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64638-1-8-1","ko":"스케줄을 좀 맞춰 보자. 너는 언제 시간이 돼?","zh":"我们试着安排一下时间吧。你什么时候有空？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"스케줄을","meaning":"时间表，日程表，日程","explanation":"스케줄：时间表，日程表，日程；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"스케줄","audio":"/audio/b3e145ec95fe4376fadc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64638","senseId":"1","lemma":"스케줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스케줄을","audio":"/audio/ba02aed07c4480b7d9f9.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"맞춰","meaning":"统一，协调","explanation":"맞추다：统一，协调；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맞추다","audio":"/audio/007d45bc6c182fe5443f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74127","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞춰","audio":"/audio/c9803242a59a4fbefcde.mp3"}},{"text":"보자.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보자","audio":"/audio/0434c803cb8571c9cf8e.mp3"}},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"돼?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b3e145ec95fe4376","term":"스케줄","zh":"时间表，日程表，日程","audio":"/audio/b3e145ec95fe4376fadc.mp3","entryId":"64638","definition":"按时间顺序排定的具体计划；或指那样的计划表。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"007d45bc6c182fe5","term":"맞추다","zh":"统一，协调","audio":"/audio/007d45bc6c182fe5443f.mp3","entryId":"74127","definition":"相互没有违和感，非常和谐。","pronunciation":["맏추다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd1610fac38cb85f21ef.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64638-1-8-2","ko":"나는 월요일만 빼고 다 괜찮아.","zh":"除了周一，其他时间我都方便。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"월요일만","meaning":"星期一，周一，礼拜一","explanation":"월요일：星期一，周一，礼拜一；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"월요일","audio":"/audio/6c95540e90f1a66864be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70069","senseId":"1","lemma":"월요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"월요일만","audio":"/audio/6f6c298a19c2983ba066.mp3"}},{"text":"빼고","meaning":"减，扣，除","explanation":"빼다：减，扣，除；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"빼다","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85714","senseId":"2","lemma":"빼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼고","audio":"/audio/f941948a515dbdf787c3.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아.","meaning":"方便、没问题（安排时间）","explanation":"괜찮다：方便、没问题（安排时间）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아","audio":"/audio/87dea6f32ecb5a9bbac8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或